{"product_id":"the-mediator-4-young-blood","title":"The Mediator 4 : Young Blood","description":"\u003cp\u003eSuze should be spending the summer vacation at the beach. Instead, she's been forced to get a babysitting job at a swanky resort. She'd expected to look after some boring brat, so Suze is surprised to find that her charge is actually a budding mediator - with a totally hot older brother. Not that Suze's head could be turned by some guy - she's pledged her heart to Jesse, the most gorgeous ghost ever. But, it's tough when the boy you love doesn't seem to love you back, and it's even tougher when you think you've found his 150-year-old grave in your backyard. Suze knows it's dangerous to dig up the past, but how can she focus on babysitting when she could be close to discovering who killed Jesse?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Meg Cabot\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780330437400\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297448681625,"sku":"4RF9780330437400","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/TGG.jpg?v=1752084510","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-mediator-4-young-blood","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}